            "section": "Section A",
            "type": "mcq",
            "marks": 1,
            "question": "The value of $(625)^{0.16} \\times (625)^{0.09}$ is",
            "options": [
                "5",
                "25",
                "125",
                "625"
            ],
            "finalAnswer": "(a) 5",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "$(625)^{0.16 + 0.09} = (625)^{0.25} = (625)^{1/4}$.",
                "$625 = 5^4$. So $(5^4)^{1/4} = 5$."
            ]
        },
        {
