            "question": "In a triangle ABC, $\\angle B=90^\\circ$ and $AB=BC=5$ cm. Find the area and its perimeter.",
            "finalAnswer": "Area: 12.5 cm², Perimeter: $10+5\\sqrt{2}$ cm",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "Area = $1/2 \\times 5 \\times 5 = 12.5$ cm².",
