            "question": "Case Study 2: Surface Area of Sphere \\nA shot-put is a metallic sphere of radius 4.9 cm. \\ni) Find its volume. (3 Marks) \\nii) If the density of metal is 7.8 g/cm³, find the mass of the shot-put. (2 Marks)",
            "finalAnswer": "i) 493 cm³, ii) 3.8 kg (approx)",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "i) Volume = $(4/3) \\times (22/7) \\times 4.9^3 \\approx 493$ cm³.",
